      "ratingsUrls": {
        "rt": "https://www.rottentomatoes.com/tv/hijack",
        "mc": "https://www.metacritic.com/tv/hijack",
        "mal": ""
      },
      "synopsis": "Told in real time, Hijack is a tense thriller that follows the journey of a hijacked plane as it makes its way to London over a seven-hour flight, as authorities on the ground scramble for answers. Sam Nelson is an accomplished negotiator in the business world who needs to step up and use all his guile to try and save the lives of the passengers — but his high-risk strategy could be his undoing.",
      "comments": "Season 2 really fell off, I found it a struggle to watch it weekly to the point where I was behind a few weeks and had to catch up. Unlike season 1 the cast of supporting characters were not fleshed out enough nor were their roles interesting. There were a set of characters that didn't even interact unless via phone with the main character (Idris) and it was so weird. I still like the premise of the show, it's total dadcore which can be nice to turn brain off, but this was a huge let down from the surprise hit of season 1. I'll watch S3 hoping it turns it around.",
      "tvmazeUrl": "https://www.tvmaze.com/shows/61739/hijack",
      "image": "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_portrait/608/1521070.jpg",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-08T07:35:39.675Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-08T15:40:45.467Z"
    },
