        "mal": ""
      },
      "synopsis": "Bait is about a struggling actor, whose last chance to hit it big comes in the form of an audition of a lifetime. The series follows him over the course of four wild days as his life spirals out of control and his family, ex-lover and the entire world weigh in on whether he is the right man for the job.",
      "comments": "Really well done for a first tv show from Riz Ahmed. Takes on a lot of heavy issues such a racism and fitting into stereotypes but done with serious tact and sprinkled with comedy. I will definitely check out S2 if it gets picked up.",
