      "comments": "Great cast, very mid execution. I think this show suffered a lot from budget by the end of it and it showed on screen. I think I'd put this into \"dadcore\" tv, so if you're into that it might be a decent background watch. It harkens more into mid-late 2000s type of show, something you'd find on TNT or USA network. There are a few twists but none of them I found too interesting. Might watch S2 if nothing else is on, or as a filler. I think there are better dadcore shows out there.",
